<title>THAILAND: Tisco pays six month dividend of three baht.</title>
<headline>Tisco pays six month dividend of three baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai finance and securities firm Tisco Investment and Securties Plc said on Wednesday it will pay a dividend of three baht per share for the six months ended to 31 December 1996.</p>
<p>In a statement to the Stock Exchange of Thailand the company said payment would be made on 28 May, 1997.</p>
